join techcorp_interviewer center

techcorp_interviewer: Bagaimana anda mengatasi bug yang sulit?

[signal arg="timer_start"]

- Debug step by step dan cek documentation
	set {interview_score} += 12
	set {interview_health} += 12
	[signal arg="timer_end"]
	techcorp_interviewer: Solid approach! Systematic thinking is key.
	[signal arg="correct_choice"]

- Tanya di Stack Overflow
	set {interview_score} += 8
	set {interview_health} += 8
	[signal arg="timer_end"]
	techcorp_interviewer: Good resource, tapi jangan terlalu bergantung.
	[signal arg="correct_choice"]

- Restart komputer dan coba lagi
	set {interview_score} -= 5
	set {interview_health} -= 5
	[signal arg="timer_end"]
	techcorp_interviewer: That's... not how debugging works.
	[signal arg="wrong_choice"]

- Hapus semua dan coding ulang
	set {interview_score} -= 15
	set {interview_health} -= 15
	[signal arg="timer_end"]
	techcorp_interviewer: Extreme dan tidak efisien. Big no.
	[signal arg="wrong_choice"]

